<title>UK: BPB says Gormly to be next chairman.</title>
<headline>BPB says Gormly to be next chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Building materials group BPB Industries Plc said on Thursday that Allan Gormly is to succeed Alan Turner as chairman at the August 1 annual meeting.</p>
<p>Gormly is currently deputy chairman and Turner has been chairman since 1985, after joining the group in 1962.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
